### Health
GET http://localhost:8000/health

### Verify eligible carrier
POST http://localhost:8000/carriers/verify
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: hr-backend-key-2026-ignacio

{"mc_number": "MC-123456"}

### Verify ineligible carrier
POST http://localhost:8000/carriers/verify
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: hr-backend-key-2026-ignacio

{"mc_number": "INACTIVE-999"}

### Search all loads
POST http://localhost:8000/loads/search
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: hr-backend-key-2026-ignacio

{}

### Search Reefer loads from Chicago
POST http://localhost:8000/loads/search
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: hr-backend-key-2026-ignacio

{"origin": "Chicago", "equipment_type": "Reefer"}

### Negotiate - accept
POST http://localhost:8000/negotiations/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: hr-backend-key-2026-ignacio

{"call_id":"test-001","load_id":"L-1001","carrier_mc_number":"MC-123","round_number":1,"carrier_offer":2500.0}

### Negotiate - reject round 3
POST http://localhost:8000/negotiations/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: hr-backend-key-2026-ignacio

{"call_id":"test-002","load_id":"L-1001","carrier_mc_number":"MC-123","round_number":3,"carrier_offer":9999.0}

### Log a call
POST http://localhost:8000/calls/log
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: hr-backend-key-2026-ignacio

{"call_id":"manual-001","carrier_mc_number":"MC-123456","carrier_name":"Test Carrier","selected_load_id":"L-1001","final_offer":2500.0,"outcome":"booked","sentiment":"positive","transcript_summary":"Test call."}

### Metrics summary
GET http://localhost:8000/metrics/summary
X-API-Key: hr-backend-key-2026-ignacio

### Recent calls
GET http://localhost:8000/metrics/calls
